# MetaHuman Lab's bindings for coax/web/wgsl-module.coax (NAME GROUP BINDING [uniform VEC4FS]), as
# coax/web/host.js lays them out: group 0 the frame's uniforms (metahumanlab.coax's 392 floats); group 1
# the scene (the human pack's vertices, the pose store, the pack's layers and their sampler); group 2
# the shadow map.
u 0 0 uniform 98
vertices 1 0
pose 1 1
sheets 1 2
sheet 1 3
shadow_map 2 0
shadow_cmp 2 1
